# F6.3: the icon view's sizes. run.sh's tree: f01 .. f60 (60 entries). The window is 936x490: beside
# the sidebar 712 px for cells, 410 for their rows. At 48 px 6 across and 3 down; 32: 6 by 4;
# 64: 5 by 3; 96: 4 by 2; 128: 3 by 2; 256: 2 by 1.
settle
key ctrl-1
expect view=icons zoom=48 cols=6 rows=3 cellw=112 cellh=104 zoomshown=1 iconpx=48 icontex=96
shot zoom-48.png
# Ctrl+= through the key callback (GLFW_KEY_EQUAL 61, Ctrl 2); a size bigger is Yaru's 256@2x made
# 128 px (64 at scale 2) as it loads, not its 48@2x scaled up.
raw-key 61 2
expect zoom=64 cols=5 rows=3 cellw=128 cellh=120 iconpx=64 icontex=128
sh grep -qx zoom=64 "$OFX_ROOT/state/ofx/state"
shot zoom-64.png
# Ctrl++ (Shift held, 3), the keypad's + (334); Ctrl+= at 256 stays.
raw-key 61 3
expect zoom=96 cols=4 rows=2 cellw=160 icontex=192
raw-key 334 2
expect zoom=128 cols=3 rows=2 cellw=192 icontex=256
key ctrl-equal
expect zoom=256 cols=2 rows=1 cellw=320 cellh=312 icontex=512
shot zoom-256.png
key ctrl-equal
expect zoom=256
# Ctrl+- (45), the keypad's - (333), Ctrl+0 (48) back to 48, then the smallest.
raw-key 45 2
expect zoom=128
raw-key 333 2
expect zoom=96
raw-key 48 2
expect zoom=48 cols=6 rows=3
key ctrl-minus
expect zoom=32 cols=6 rows=4 cellw=112 cellh=88 icontex=64
shot zoom-32.png
key ctrl-minus
expect zoom=32
key ctrl-0
expect zoom=48
# ---- the cursor's row on screen kept: on the top row (entry 40, rows from 36), at 64 px it is
# still the top row (from 40), where the least scroll would have left it on the second (from 35).
key end
keys up up up
expect idx=41 top=36
key ctrl-equal
expect idx=41 top=40 cols=5
key ctrl-0
expect idx=41 top=36 cols=6
key home
expect top=0
# ---- the slider: the plus and minus, a press on the track, the knob dragged
point-ui zoom-in
click-here
expect zoom=64
point-ui zoom-out
click-here
expect zoom=48
click-here
expect zoom=32
# At 32 the minus does nothing.
click-here
expect zoom=32
point-ui zoom-notch 3
click-here
expect zoom=96
point-ui zoom-knob
drag-here 100
expect zoom=256
point-ui zoom-knob
drag-here -30
expect zoom=96
point-ui zoom-knob
drag-here -500
expect zoom=32
# The track's tooltip says the size; the plus's its key.
point-ui zoom-track
hover-here
idle
expect tooltip=Icons_32_px_(Ctrl+0:_48_px) tipin=1
point-ui zoom-in
hover-here
idle
expect tooltip=Bigger_icons_(Ctrl+=) tipin=1
shot zoom-tip.png
point-ui view-list
hover-here
# ---- Ctrl+wheel over the files: a size a notch; the plain wheel still scrolls
wheel 1 ctrl
expect zoom=48 top=0
wheel 2 ctrl
expect zoom=64
wheel -1 ctrl
expect zoom=48
wheel -3
expect zoom=48 top=18
wheel 3
expect top=0
# ---- the list doesn't zoom: no slider, the keys and Ctrl+wheel do nothing
key ctrl-2
expect view=list zoomshown=0 iconpx=24 rows=14
key ctrl-equal
wheel 1 ctrl
expect zoom=48 view=list
shot zoom-list.png
# Back to the icons at the size they had; 128 is remembered for f63b.
key ctrl-1
expect view=icons zoom=48 zoomshown=1
key ctrl-equal
key ctrl-equal
key ctrl-equal
expect zoom=128 cols=3
sh grep -qx zoom=128 "$OFX_ROOT/state/ofx/state"
quit
